# ── Firebase project IDs (source of truth) ────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values. The wedding app runs on
# the `boda-500805` project. The MCP firebase server may default to another
# project (e.g. `famillyxp`) — always override with the correct project.

